 what sorts of people were likely to survive. In particular, we ask you to apply the tools of machine learning to predict which passengers survived the tragedy. This Kaggle Getting Started Competition provides an ideal starting place for people who may not have a lot of experience in data science and machine learning.\"","topics":[],"score":216167,"global_rank":232043},{"name":"nimakam/attoco","owner":"nimakam","html_url":"https://github.com/nimakam/attoco","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":"Attoco LLC","topics":[],"score":216167,"global_rank":232044},{"name":"meghanmullally/third","owner":"meghanmullally","html_url":"https://github.com/meghanmullally/third","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":1,"language":"HTML","description":null,"topics":[],"score":216167,"global_rank":232056},{"name":"aiy-wish/homepage","owner":"aiy-wish","html_url":"https://github.com/aiy-wish/homepage","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":null,"topics":[],"score":216166,"global_rank":232063},{"name":"TraceDugar/cookie-stand","owner":"TraceDugar","html_url":"https://github.com/TraceDugar/cookie-stand","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":"A website that is built for a ficitonal international business that sells salmon shaped cookies that contain salmon in them.  This was done using vanilla Javascript, HTML and CSS","topics":["css3","html5","table","vanilla-javascript"],"score":216166,"global_rank":232072},{"name":"LucianSoto/HTML-assignment-1","owner":"LucianSoto","html_url":"https://github.com/LucianSoto/HTML-assignment-1","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":"First HTML Assignment","topics":[],"score":216166,"global_rank":232075},{"name":"kdrummond528/first-day-repo","owner":"kdrummond528","html_url":"https://github.com/kdrummond528/first-day-repo","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":null,"t